Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:10.00,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,500,4500,5400)\pos(650.323,403.055)}Episode 54\N\N\N\N\NThe Battle of Hefei
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.61,0:00:16.16,Thinking,,0,0,0,,While Liu Bei and Sun Quan fought over Jing Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.22,0:00:20.01,Thinking,,0,0,0,,they expanded their territory to bolster their strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.78,0:00:23.28,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao, now made the "Duke of Wei,"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.32,0:00:26.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,now controlled vast stretches of land to the north of Yangzi River,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.66,0:00:34.29,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and personally led troops to once again restart his great ambition of vying for the Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.27,0:00:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord need not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.78,0:00:46.50,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(312.495,205.909)}Zhuge Liang\NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan that can make Cao Cao retreat willingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.21,0:00:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What would that plan be?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.65,0:00:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao has sent the three generals Zhang Liao, Li Dian, and Yue Jin,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.02,0:01:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,to garrison Hefei with heavy troops, in fear of Sun Quan's incursion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.13,0:01:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If my Lord were to return the commanderies of Jiangxia, Changsha, and Guiyang back to Sun Quan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.70,0:01:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and send an able ambassador to convince him to attack Hefei,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.72,0:01:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,then Cao Cao would surely lead his troops southward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.11,0:01:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, our Yi Province will be secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.78,0:01:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who shall we send there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentleman of the Household Yi Ji is capable of carrying out this duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.18,0:01:36.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(334.328,210)}Liu Bei\NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.74,0:01:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Yi Ji, sent by Imperial Uncle Liu, have come to greet the Marquis of Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.50,0:02:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}What brings Gentleman of \Nthe Household Yi here from afar?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.90,0:02:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}To return the three commanderies of Jiangxia, Changsha, {\bord12}and Guiyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.98,0:02:09.43,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(955.224,268.636)}Sun Quan\NStyled: Zhòngmóu
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.43,0:02:11.32,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1002.985,295.909)}Lu Su\NStyled: Zǐjìng
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.34,0:02:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}When Zhuge Ziyu had gone to get the three commanderies,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.74,0:02:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}{\pos(640,664)}why did you refuse back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.51,0:02:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}This is because our Strategos Zhuge was not present to make the cession.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.78,0:02:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Then why not return the other commanderies of Jing Province as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.87,0:02:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The commanderies of Nan and Lingling were to be returned as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.10,0:02:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}but Cao Cao attacked the east side of the Riverlands, {\bord12}and General Guan had no place to stay,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.14,0:02:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}{\pos(640,664)}so the return has to be delayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.50,0:02:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}{\pos(640,664)}Sire, Hefei is now unguarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.28,0:02:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}I hope that Marquis may raise arms against it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.72,0:02:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}so that Cao Cao may return southward.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.26,0:02:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}If my Lord obtains the Eastern Riverlands,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}he will return the entirety of Jing Province!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.38,0:01:55.22,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(992.068,255)}Yi Ji\NStyled: Jībó
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.50,0:03:06.38,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(285.203,325.909)}Zhang Zhao\NStyled: Zǐbù
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.98,0:03:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Liu Bei's stratagem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.88,0:03:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is a personal letter from Imperial Uncle Liu to the Marquis of Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, this is Liu Bei's ploy to protect his Western Riverlands from Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.98,0:03:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Zhang's words are right,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.21,0:03:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but only half right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.75,0:03:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.81,0:03:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Cao Cao is a champion of deceit. He has long desired to annex Shu and Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.30,0:03:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}{\pos(640,664)}If he were to gain the Western Riverlands,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.07,0:03:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}he would carry his momentum southward, and Eastern Wu would collapse as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.82,0:03:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}This is the first issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.58,0:04:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Secondly, once Marquis attacks Hefei, \Nmy Lord will enter the Eastern Riverlands,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.30,0:04:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}keeping Cao Cao in check from two sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.52,0:04:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}His momentum will be strangled, \Nand both Shu and Wu will be safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.91,0:04:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Thirdly, Cao Cao is now at Hanzhong, leaving Hefei unguarded—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.22,0:04:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}and its guarding officer Li Dian \Ndetests Zhang Liao.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.64,0:04:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Should Marquis take this opportunity to raise arms and seize it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.36,0:04:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}victory will be certain!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.22,0:04:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Sir Zhang, is this strategy of Imperial Uncle Liu advisable?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.98,0:04:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentleman of the Household Yi, please return to the guest chambers to rest for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.87,0:04:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. I hope that Marquis makes a decision soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.08,0:04:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, how do you see this matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.47,0:04:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, though this is Liu Bei's ploy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.07,0:05:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,it would indeed be beneficial for Eastern Wu \Nto attack Hefei now, while Cao Cao is at Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.83,0:05:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe it is a good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.34,0:05:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, Yi Ji's words are well advised.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.26,0:05:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Gather the troops immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.62,0:05:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang, the Wu army is attacking Wancheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.84,0:05:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Administrator Zhu requests immediate aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.17,0:05:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! How many soldiers does Wu have?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.04,0:05:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wu army is besieging the city, numbering fifty thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.62,0:05:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun Quan is leading in person, with \NLü Meng and Gan Ning as vanguards.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.62,0:05:25.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(966.141,278.182)}Zhang Liao\NStyled: Wényuǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.84,0:05:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Reports suggest that Ling Tong's troops will arrive soon. Reinforcements are required.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.27,0:05:27.50,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(962.047,260.455)}Li Dian\NStyled: Mànchéng
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.52,0:05:30.70,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(330.235,229.091)}Yue Jin\NStyled: Wénqiān
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.74,0:05:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wu army might breach the walls soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.42,0:05:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-Scout again.\N-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.72,0:05:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The situation is critical.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.54,0:05:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Which of you two generals is willing to lead the reinforcements?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hefei has no more than ten thousand troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.12,0:05:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with all of them, it would be a difficult battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.86,0:05:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Should Sun Quan attack here, would it not be a loss on both fronts?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.18,0:05:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,General, in your opinion,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.34,0:05:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,are we to sit and watch Wancheng fall into enemy hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.88,0:06:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Better that than losing Hefei as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You-!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.60,0:06:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wenqian, what is your opinion?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.68,0:06:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wancheng is in dire circumstances and should be rescued,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.73,0:06:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,but General Li Dian's worries are not without reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.78,0:06:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals, please rest easy in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.34,0:06:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I will lead the rescue myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.30,0:06:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready my horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.34,0:06:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Rush into the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.06,0:06:53.62,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(951.13,305.455)}Gan Ning\NStyled: Xìngbà
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.46,0:07:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.29,0:07:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang, Wancheng has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.18,0:07:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Administrator Zhu has been slain by Gan Ning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.46,0:07:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.73,0:07:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,-Scout again!\N-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.78,0:07:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.38,0:07:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun Quan intends to take Hefei with the attack on Wancheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.78,0:07:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Should Hefei be lost, \Nthe Central Plains will be in grave danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.62,0:07:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor must beware.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.02,0:07:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I have taken precautions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I have ordered the three generals Zhang Liao, Li Dian, and Yue Jin to defend Hefei.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.86,0:07:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,These three men are all capable generals,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.46,0:07:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,who are both resourceful and brave. \NThey will not falter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.02,0:07:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The numbers are on the enemy's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.56,0:07:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They can only be repelled by \Nsubstituting attack for defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.02,0:07:54.62,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(975.693,261.818)}Liu Ye\NStyled: Zǐyáng
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.14,0:07:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But if all direct battle is avoided \Nand Sun Quan attacks with reinforcements,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.14,0:08:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,the city walls will eventually be breached.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.62,0:08:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Generals Zhang and Li have never seen eye to eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.74,0:08:06.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(335.693,234.545)}Cao Cao\NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.54,0:08:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If this remains the case, \Nhow can they defeat the enemy together?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.90,0:08:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, something must be done to guard against their hindering of each other just to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.84,0:08:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me that wooden box.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.72,0:08:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.10,0:08:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,With these words, Hefei will be secured.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.58,0:08:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.87,0:08:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Send someone to Hefei, no stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.40,0:09:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They must give this wooden box over to General Zhang Liao.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.36,0:09:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.94,0:09:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fellow warriors,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.37,0:09:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,our army has taken Wancheng in one fell swoop, and our lord has greatly rewarded the troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.99,0:09:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, we celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.58,0:09:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,General Gan deserves the greatest credit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.66,0:09:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, let us raise a toast to General Gan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.63,0:09:27.74,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(337.058,249.545)}Ling Tong\NStyled: Gōngjì
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.67,0:09:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.12,0:09:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, General Gan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.78,0:09:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, General Gan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.50,0:09:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.62,0:09:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.50,0:09:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,General Gan, leading by example, showed no fear under a hail of arrows and stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,His valor has surpassed that \Nof the entire army. Truly admirable!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:10:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, let us all toast to General Gan again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.42,0:10:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Another toast to General Gan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.26,0:10:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.26,0:10:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no entertainment in the banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.42,0:10:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me perform a sword dance for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.72,0:10:29.20,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(337.058,248.182)}Lü Meng \NStyled: Ziming
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.54,0:10:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Generals, for offering wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.54,0:10:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please watch me dance with these halberds to entertain everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.06,0:11:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fetch our lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.27,0:11:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.58,0:11:43.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I have always told you two to let go of old hostilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.43,0:11:47.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why quarrel like this today?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.78,0:11:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, my father was murdered by Gan Ning,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and today is the anniversary of his death!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.38,0:12:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.22,0:12:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, your father and General Gan fought for their own lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.02,0:12:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, you two are both my beloved generals and should be like family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.38,0:12:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you bear grudges?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.17,0:12:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongji, you are a thoughtful man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.06,0:12:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You value loyalty over wealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.36,0:12:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please prioritize the matters of state and let go of your grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.40,0:12:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.86,0:12:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Xingba, Gongji's low mood today is only natural,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.90,0:12:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,not to mention that he is your junior. \NTry to give him some leeway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.98,0:13:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well said, my Lord. I understand my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.60,0:13:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your idea was brilliant, Strategos.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.50,0:13:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun Quan has indeed sent troops and taken Wancheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.74,0:13:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I suspect that Cao Cao will soon retreat from Hanzhong and move down south.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Patience, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.18,0:13:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He will not act rashly \Nunless the situation at Hefei becomes untenable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.51,0:13:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wancheng was Hefei's supply depot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.84,0:13:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun Quan was wise to conquer Wancheng first and attack of Hefei later,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.72,0:13:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but Zhang Liao will now defend all the more fiercely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.23,0:13:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao is prepared to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.27,0:13:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He will not retreat south just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.03,0:13:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.18,0:14:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We should take this chance to strengthen the land of Shu's defenses and gain the people's support.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.30,0:14:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we are stable, Cao Cao will not dare to attack us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.98,0:14:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-Report!\N-What is the situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun Quan's army of 100,000 has arrived south of Xiaoyao Ford, and is approaching Hefei!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.74,0:14:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun Quan has now conquered Wancheng and leads a hundred thousand troops to attack Hefei.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.74,0:14:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do the two generals have any plans to repel the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.86,0:15:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang, on Chancellor's orders, I deliver this box to General.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.42,0:15:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh, you come from Hanzhong?\N-Indeed, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.54,0:15:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Thank you. Go and have some rest.\N-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.82,0:15:22.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Issue once the marauder comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.94,0:15:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit, sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.74,0:15:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor's command: \N"Issue once the marauder comes."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.58,0:15:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Sun Quan is here, this box can be opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.24,0:15:57.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,If Sun Quan's troops arrive, Generals Zhang and Li sally forth to fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.58,0:15:59.96,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and General Yue stays to defend the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.26,0:16:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.38,0:16:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals, our lord is far away at Hanzhong, but he remains worried about the matters of Hefei.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.70,0:16:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we, as leading officers, not be ashamed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.58,0:16:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What should be done, in General's opinion?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.70,0:16:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun Quan believes that with our lord away, we can easily be defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.46,0:16:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, we can send troops to meet him, fight hard, and break his momentum.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.12,0:16:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The hearts of our men will be assured, and the defense of Hefei may be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.98,0:16:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What is Wenqian's opinion?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.82,0:16:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy is numerous and we are paltry in number.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.30,0:16:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be better to stay on the defensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.21,0:16:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are thinking of yourselves, not the big picture!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.70,0:17:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lord's worry is, indeed, because of the sheer difference in numbers,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.66,0:17:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,fearing that we three men will be unable to mount an adequate defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.70,0:17:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,For this reason, he sent a man from afar to deliver this box,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.46,0:17:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,to confer this plan of repelling the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.62,0:17:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The animosity between Mancheng and I is a personal matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.02,0:17:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, with the enemy present,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.98,0:17:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,how can a warrior let a mere grudge get in the way of his duty?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.58,0:17:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.42,0:17:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You can sit idly by here in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.44,0:17:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I will face the enemy and fight to the death!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.94,0:17:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.98,0:17:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang is loyal and just.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.73,0:17:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we let our feelings interfere with our duty? \NAt your command, General Zhang.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Yue Jin, am yours to command as well, General Zhang.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.34,0:18:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mancheng.\N-At your command, General Zhang.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mancheng, order troops to lay an ambush to the north of Xiaoyao Ford.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.30,0:18:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the Wu army crosses Xiaoshi Bridge, destroy the bridge immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.36,0:18:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, Wenqian and I will strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.10,0:18:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.95,0:18:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wenqian, once you engage the enemy, feign defeat and fall back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.22,0:18:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the enemy has caught up, you must give chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.74,0:18:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.38,0:18:27.38,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1007.079,413.182)}Xiǎoshī Bridge
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.19,0:19:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,General, shall we take down the bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.14,0:19:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. This is the vanguard led by Lü Meng and Gan Ning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.23,0:19:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for Sun Quan's troops to cross first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.56,0:19:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.02,0:19:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun Quan has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.18,0:19:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, General Gan of the vanguard defeated Cao Cao's General Yue and is now in pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.58,0:19:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,General Lü is chasing as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.42,0:19:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Good. Keep scouting.\N-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.72,0:20:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-Take down the bridge.\N-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.95,0:20:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Hefei will be taken easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.58,0:20:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.07,0:21:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-Fall back at once!\N-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.98,0:21:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Fall back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.29,0:21:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly call Gan Ning and Lü Meng to aid us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.31,0:21:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,General Gan! General Gan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.30,0:21:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,General Gan, hurry...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.54,0:21:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,...hurry, rescue our lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.93,0:21:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We've fallen into their trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.86,0:21:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lord has been surrounded on both sides by Zhang Liao and Li Dian. The situation is critical!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.14,0:21:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Rescue our lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.38,0:22:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, fall back. To Xiaoshi Bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.74,0:22:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.32,0:22:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, move your horse back, \Nand jump over the bridge with a running start!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.42,0:23:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's battle was exhilarating.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.78,0:23:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Had Sun Quan's horse not jumped across, I would have captured him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.22,0:23:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Without General Zhang's guidance, I would have botched this great opportunity. How ashamed I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.06,0:23:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,General's ability to seize the chance with skill and wit shows his worth as lead officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.50,0:23:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Chancellor we should thank for our victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.62,0:23:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Had Chancellor not sent the letter in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.02,0:23:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,how could we work together and achieve this great victory?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.02,0:23:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor is brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.38,0:23:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mancheng, Wenqian, and Sun Quan will not accept defeat so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.30,0:23:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, he will raise another army to attack Hefei again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.98,0:23:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We should send someone to Hanzhong quickly to request reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.54,0:24:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.68,0:24:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The three generals received the wooden box and sallied forth to face the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.82,0:24:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They secured a decisive victory at Xiaoyao Ford,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.34,0:24:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and almost captured Sun Quan alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.70,0:24:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.52,0:24:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This battle broke the Wu troops' morale completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.27,0:24:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Lü Meng and Gan Ning narrowly escaped death.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.93,0:24:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, the mere mention of General Zhang Liao's name
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.38,0:24:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,instills such fear that children dare not cry at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.90,0:24:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wenyuan has truly proven himself as a senior general.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.68,0:24:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all thanks to Chancellor's wise judgement.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.90,0:25:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Can the Western Riverlands be taken at this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.14,0:25:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei and Zhuge Liang are well-prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.20,0:25:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A rushed attack could end poorly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.70,0:25:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What is Sűn Quan up to right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.56,0:25:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao is personally leading forty thousand troops from Hanzhong to aid Hefei.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.18,0:25:25.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I have ordered Dong Xi and Xu Sheng to lead \Nfifty ships to lay an ambush at the river's confluence.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.88,0:25:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I have also ordered Chen Wu to lead a detachment to patrol along the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.14,0:25:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, what other esteemed thoughts can you share?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.06,0:25:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, the Cao army comes from afar and has not yet gained a foothold.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.66,0:25:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If we stall its momentum, \Nthen we will have an opportunity to strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.58,0:25:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Zhang's words ring true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.04,0:25:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who will harass the enemy \Nand break their momentum?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.14,0:25:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, I am willing to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.74,0:25:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How many troops will you take?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.27,0:25:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Three thousand will be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.42,0:26:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. I shall give you three thousand men.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.42,0:26:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, just a hundred horsemen are enough to disrupt the enemy. Why three thousand?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.74,0:26:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.78,0:26:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare look down on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.11,0:26:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You...!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.93,0:26:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.20,0:26:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The Cao army's strength is great, do not underestimate the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.38,0:26:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Gongji.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.15,0:26:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Send out a detachment to Ruxukou.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.30,0:26:35.94,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Ruxukou（濡须口）: the confluence of Ruxu River and Yangzi River.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.86,0:26:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike at the Cao troops on sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.82,0:26:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.22,0:26:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.22,0:26:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Ziming.\N-Here, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.62,0:26:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to leave shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.90,0:26:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything happens to Gongji, assist him back to the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.22,0:26:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.22,0:27:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, I will only need a hundred men tonight to raid the Cao camp. Their force will be disrupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.10,0:27:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I get the opportunity, I will take Cao Cao's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.24,0:27:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If I lose even a single man or horse, do not count it as a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.30,0:27:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.26,0:29:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A raid! The Wu troops are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.82,0:29:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.14,0:29:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,General Gan,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.54,0:29:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.78,0:30:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, they're back! General Gan is triumphant!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.58,0:30:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, I have returned. A hundred men and mounts, not a single casualty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.58,0:30:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, please make a count.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.86,0:30:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, I've counted the troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.98,0:30:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A hundred and one, not a single fewer!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.78,0:30:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,General's raid has frightened the traitor Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.61,0:30:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hesitant to let you take risks,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.64,0:30:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but I wanted to test the courage of my adept generals of Jiangdong.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.35,0:30:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.58,0:30:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, Senior General Zhang Liao of the Cao army has come to challenge us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.88,0:30:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.06,0:31:01.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao has Zhang Liao, and I have Gan Xingba.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.88,0:31:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-My lord.\N-My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.41,0:31:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I am willing to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.27,0:31:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.50,0:31:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,With Gongji going, we will succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.50,0:31:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I grant you three thousand troops. \NI will watch over the battle in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.94,0:31:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.88,0:32:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongji, how is the wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.38,0:32:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, I have sullied our prestige. I have disappointed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.59,0:32:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise, rise. No need for sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.86,0:32:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It was only because Traitor Cao shot an arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.70,0:32:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, which general saved my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.70,0:32:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Who among you saved me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.54,0:32:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongji, the man who shot an arrow to save you...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.90,0:33:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,...It was Xingba!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.38,0:33:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, General, for this life-saving grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.94,0:33:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,General Ling, General Ling.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.02,0:33:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,General Gan, I did not distinguish between public and private manners and vilified you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.68,0:33:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so ashamed!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.30,0:33:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,General Ling, please rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.68,0:33:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can never repay even a fraction of General's generosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.10,0:33:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Should General allow it, I would like us to make a bond of life and death,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.20,0:33:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,so that we may be brothers forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.98,0:33:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongji!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.30,0:33:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Xingba!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.14,0:33:46.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao led four hundred thousand troops from Hanzhong to save Hefei,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.38,0:33:51.10,Thinking,,0,0,0,,but before gaining a foothold, he suffered two defeats in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.50,0:33:54.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao, greatly angered, \Npersonally led the Central Army
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.94,0:33:58.22,Thinking,,0,0,0,,to launch an attack on Ruxukou from five directions,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.82,0:34:03.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,claiming that he would surely capture \NSun Quan alive to regain the pride of his army.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.14,0:34:24.50,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(309.765,245.455)}Zhou Tai\NStyled: Yòupíng
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.42,0:34:27.46,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(369.808,216.818)}Pang De\NStyled: Lìngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.10,0:34:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.34,0:34:45.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(285.203,316.364)}Jia Xu\NStyled: Wénhé
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.22,0:34:48.54,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: In Yang Province
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.34,0:34:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}This man is from Xiacai, Jiujiang Commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.80,0:34:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}He is of the family Zhou, his given name Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.96,0:34:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}He was an old subordinate of Sun Ce, \Nhis valor among the greatest of Jiangdong.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.68,0:35:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}His fame is no less than that of Gan Ning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.82,0:35:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Who could anticipate that the home of poetry and brocades would hold a tiger general as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.02,0:35:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,When his Lord is in danger, how can a warrior not put his life on the line?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.90,0:35:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Youping.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.06,0:35:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.98,0:35:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-Please take off your robe.\N-My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.42,0:35:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.46,0:35:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you get this injury?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.10,0:35:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In the midst of the battle, my Lord was at the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.50,0:35:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw two enemy soldiers trying to attack my Lord from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.62,0:35:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I turned my lance against them, but I was stabbed by a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.64,0:36:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhou.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.26,0:36:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Please.\N-My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.58,0:36:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.42,0:36:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you get this injury?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.52,0:36:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,During the retreat, my Lord was behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.58,0:36:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw someone trying to shoot an arrow at my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.50,0:36:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I swung my lance to block the arrow, but I was wounded by a spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.14,0:36:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, General Zhou.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.62,0:36:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.50,0:37:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, I have had enough wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.42,0:37:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,One cup of wine per wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.78,0:37:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I shall be drunk with my general.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.66,0:37:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, my Lord. Please, fellow warriors!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.42,0:37:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.82,0:37:40.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,This war between Cao Cao and Sun Quan
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.62,0:37:45.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,ended with Eastern Wu suing for peace \Nand the borders remaining as they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.74,0:37:48.70,Thinking,,0,0,0,,When Cao Cao returned north with his troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.94,0:37:50.78,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,he could not have known that,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.78,0:37:54.22,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,from then on, he would never again enter Jiangnan
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.42,0:37:58.70,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and have the chance to conquer Eastern Wu for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.58,0:38:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}If a son is born, let him be like Sun Zhongmou.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.54,0:38:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Eastern Wu has tiger generals indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.75,0:38:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}It seems that if I wish to pacify Jiangnan,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.54,0:38:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}it will take some more time...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.82,0:38:30.58,Thinking,,0,0,0,,After Cao Cao's return,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.78,0:38:35.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,he murdered Empress Fu and her family's more than two hundred members,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.18,0:38:42.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and forced Emperor Xian to name Cao Cao's daughter empress.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.54,0:38:47.86,Thinking,,0,0,0,,He also coerced Emperor Xian to make him the "King of Wei,"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.42,0:38:55.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and permit him to name a royal successor, \Nwho would inherit Cao Cao's title.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.34,0:39:01.86,Thinking,,0,0,0,,At this time, Cao Cao's power had reached its zenith.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.66,0:39:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}I have six decades and two years behind me,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.38,0:39:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}and my great undertaking must soon be entrusted to posterity.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.62,0:39:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Lady Bian, my consort, gave birth to four sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.82,0:39:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}Of them, Zijian is most clever and sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.44,0:39:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Who to name as my successor, this matter still troubles me...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.54,0:39:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Your Majesty, naming an heir is a matter that affects all.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.98,0:39:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,664)}{\bord12}I wish only for action after careful deliberation.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.38,0:40:34.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}Dim grows the flashing of swords and daggers,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.66,0:40:39.98,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}from afar do sound the battle drums and war horns.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.34,0:40:46.78,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}Before my eyes rise only those
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.78,0:40:52.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}fresh faces, one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.86,0:40:59.10,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}Buried are the ancient paths and ways,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.10,0:41:04.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}desolate are the beacon fires and border towns.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.42,0:41:12.26,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}O, Years! You cannot take away
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.26,0:41:16.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}that succession of familiar lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.42,0:41:23.54,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}Who is it that determines what flourishes?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.54,0:41:29.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}Is there no basis to prosperity and decline?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.94,0:41:35.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}In a single page, the storm disperses,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.90,0:41:41.98,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}reshaping space and time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.98,0:41:48.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}Meeting and parting are always destined,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.30,0:41:54.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}separation and reunion always weighs in our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.38,0:42:00.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}Take the work of the living upon yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.38,0:42:06.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}unconcerned with your legacy after.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.82,0:42:12.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}The Yangtze has the will to transform into tears,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.94,0:42:19.10,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,684.333)}the Yangtze has sentiment to raise its voice in song,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.10,0:42:25.22,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}in the firmament of history\N glimmers a sprinkling of stars,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.22,0:42:46.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}the spirit of heroism in the world\N thunders onward unbridled

